":"我不记得！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF918B12F18F358BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1260007012:0":{"text":"記憶にねぇな！","source_cn":"我也不记得！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0972CA25911D34E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1260007013:1":{"text":"……正気に戻ったなら、あたしの質問に答えろ。","source_cn":"……你们都清醒清醒，我有话要问。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x310B2CBA0A777DB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1260007014:1":{"text":"ダリロ、モンスターになる前、グレイヴボーンの女を見なかったか？","source_cn":"达里洛，你们在变成怪物之前，有没有见过一个亡灵女性。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF99A385D30B2C2AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1260007015:1":{"text":"え！？あ、あれはグレイヴボーンだったのか！？","source_cn":"什、什么，她是亡灵？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x495CDC946B4DBAFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1260007016:0":{"text":"さ、さあ……あの時、兄貴たちがギャングにどう落とし前を付けさせようかって話してて、おいらは挨拶しようと近づいたんです。","source_cn":"是亡灵吗？我不确定……当时暴熊和山猫大哥在商量怎么找水...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC6346D5F3EBDA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_r