":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1260007022:1":{"text":"兄貴たちもすっかり放心状態で、相手をじっと見てましたよね！","source_cn":"当时两位大哥也僵住了，直勾勾地盯着她，都忘记了要干什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE59B6E1194565A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1260007023:0":{"text":"あ、ああ……今思えば、肌や目の色も普通じゃなかったのに、あの時はそんなの全然気にならなかった。","source_cn":"是、是啊，明明回想起来，她的肤色和眼睛都很异常……可那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC58AA3DEFF9EA85D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1260007024:0":{"text":"ただただ、綺麗で、高貴で、思わず跪きたくなるような……","source_cn":"只是觉得非常漂亮，而且很有威严，甚至忍不住想对她行礼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26F63DE077A20EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1260007025:0":{"text":"おいらもです……そこからはもう何も覚えてません。","source_cn":"我也差一点就……但紧接着，我就失去意识了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA6C303678C92230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1260007026:0":{"text":"……どうやら、またあのセシアとかいうグレイヴボーンの仕業のようだな。","source_cn":"……听起来是她，那个叫瑟西娅的亡灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A3C9C6639964869","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl